  },
  {
   "id": 231,
   "en": "Gaw-La Furia - Agents' Chamber",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 232,
   "en": "Jua-Mu",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 233,
   "en": "You called for me, Your Excellency?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 234,
   "en": "Karo-Ran",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 235,
   "en": "Jua-Mu, Fu-Ruu has fallen to the Steel Dragons.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 236,
   "en": "...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 237,
   "en": "Lead our forces and intercept the Steel Dragons.@Should you succeed, I promise you the seat@of the next Chief Agent.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 238,
   "en": "M-Me, sir...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "Yes. And as kin of the Chief Agent, your family@would be granted priority survival rights.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "(Then my dad, my mom, and Kudo-Ra...!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "Go, Jua-Mu.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
   "en": "Yes, ma'am!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 243,
   "en": "(Heh... You're nothing but a pawn to be sacrificed.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 244,
   "en": "Shana-Mia",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 245,
   "en": "Gu-Landon is in the imperial palace at the core...@past this area.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 246,
   "en": "The residential area and the Grove of Time's@Journey are on the far side of the core, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "Yes. Fighting here won't seriously harm@Gaw-La... but we mustn't overdo it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "The same should hold true@for Gu-Landon and his men.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "But what if they pull something like@using Fury civilians as shields?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "Such cruelty would harm their rule@in the future. ...Provided they have@a future, that is.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "Ain't knights supposed to be above@that kinda nasty stuff?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "...You can't say that across the board.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "If the one commanding them is an <Agent>,@they won't be picky about their methods.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "That's right... If he's a man like So-Des.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "Damn that Fu-Ruu, what a disgrace for a knight!@Letting them get inside!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "Jua-Mu Dalubi... withdraw at once.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "You've got no right to tell me that!@The Fury's new Emperor is Lord Gu-Landon!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "That's just a title he gave himself!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "Justice to the strong! Glory to the victor!@And the throne to Lord Gu-Landon!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "Like we'd ever accept that!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "Yeah... Especially if that man plans@to misuse the Cross Gate.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "Shut up, Earthlings!@When we came to Earth, we could've wiped@you all out if we'd felt like it!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "Earth belongs to the race born and raised there...@If we are to make it our home, we must@coexist with its people.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "So that's the Assimilation Plan?! Screw that!@Like hell I'll be lumped in with that trash!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "Can't you see that this contempt@will be what leads us to decline?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "Shut up! It's because you're like this!@My brother... Adu-Mu died while still@frozen in ice!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "And not just my brother!@Lots of people died in millennia-long cold sleep!@Lots of them! You know that!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "That's...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "Answer me!@Why are you with the Earthlings?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "How long do my parents and Kudo-Ra@have to stay frozen?! When will they@get to walk on real soil with their own feet?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "That's why I seek coexistence with Earthlings,@so our people can live on Earth...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "That's no good! You're no good!@That's why I'm killing you, since you're in the way!@I'll kill you!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "I can feel Jua-Mu's rage@coming through the <Sympathia>...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "He's doing it for his family...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "I'm not about to feel sorry for him.@Tenia's, Katia's, and Melua's parents are gone.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "And they destroyed Rabulpaila...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "Fairy",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "Sieg...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "He's trying to kill Princess Shana-Mia.@This is no time for pretty words.@It's kill or be killed.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "We're settling this here, Jua-Mu!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "I'll kill you right along with the Princess,@Calvinaaa!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "Th-That Raftclans is...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "It's the Aurun. Could the pilot be...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "It is Al-Van Ranks, Lady Shana-Mia.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "Y-You... I heard you were imprisoned...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "Fu-Ruu opened my cell.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "So that's how it is, Lord Al-Van!@Then let's strike down the Earthlings together!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "Jua-Mu...@The liege a knight must protect is Lady Shana-Mia.@Not Gu-Landon, who seeks the throne.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "But that woman betrayed the Fury!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "You are wrong!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "How am I wrong?!@Lord Gu-Landon rose up to protect the Fury's@pure blood, to build a new future!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Coexisting with Earthlings is out of the question!@You bastards deserve to be wiped out!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "Jua-Mu Dalubi! You dealt with Earthlings at@Ashurey Kreuzer, didn't you?! Why won't you@think of living alongside them?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "You make me sick!@How could we ever join hands with an inferior race@that never stops fighting among itself?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "Jua-Mu...@That very contempt for Earthlings@is the Fury's arrogance, and its mistake.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "You sound just like Shana-Mia...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "We can coexist with Earthlings.@Like Lord E-Selda... and like me.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "L-Lord Al-Van... You can't mean...!@You're really in love with Calvina Coulange...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "Yes. I love her.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "A... Ally...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "There is nothing special about it.@We Fury and the Earthlings are the same people...@That is why Tou-Ya and the others were born.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "Ngh, nnngh...!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "Uwaaaaaaaaaaaaah!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "!?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "Wh-What are you saying?! What the hell are you saying?!@You love that trash?! That scum?!@You, a knight?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "Jua-Mu...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "No! You're no knight anymore!!@You're my enemy! My enemy!! My enemyyy!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "Jua-Mu... I have no wish to fight you.@Please withdraw.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "Shut uuup!!@I'll kill, kill, kill you! I'll kill you along@with all the trash!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "Damn, he's completely snapped!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "There's noise in the Sympathia...!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "At this rate...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "No half-measures will stop him now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "...It cannot be helped. Let's go, Karin, Tou-Ya.@I will be your guide.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "Got it!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "Calvinaaaa!!@You! If it weren't for you!!@Kill kill kill kill killll!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "Am I... b-beaten...?!@Am I g-gonna die?! No way, come on!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "N-No, nooo!!@I-I won't accept thiiis!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "I can't die heeere!!@K-Kudo-Raaaa!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "Jua-Mu...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "In the end... he didn't use the civilians as shields.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "Because his own family... was in that place,@the Grove of Timefaring...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "Probably...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "Even after he'd become like that,@his heart still cared for the people he loved...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "...It's my fault for failing to guide him.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "No... All the blame lies with me.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "Shana-Mia...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "...Lady Shana-Mia,@I believe Gu-Landon is not in the palace,@but in Gaw-La's main power section.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "Understood.@Let us lead the Steel Dragons there.@And then we will defeat Gu-Landon.",
